  ## Alerts

  > Note
  > Threads outlive the TUI.

  > Tip
  > weave --resume finds the thread again.

  > Important
  > The Host runs the agents.

  > Warning
  > Quitting the Host ends its threads' turns.

  > Caution
  > Agent text is untrusted.

